<title>USA: Bristol-Myers Squibb to buy Choco Milk.</title>
<headline>Bristol-Myers Squibb to buy Choco Milk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bristol-Myers Squibb Co said it agreed to buy Choco Milk from Procter &amp; Gamble's Mexico operations for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>Choco Milk is Mexico's leading milk-based nutritional supplement, Bristol-Myers said.</p>
<p>It will become part of Bristol-Myers' Mead Johnson Nutritionals division after the acquisition.</p>
<p>Bristol-Myers said the acquisition is consistent with the company's strategy to grow its consumer nutritionals business.</p>
</text>
